# Reserved for cross-package test fixtures.
#
# NOTE: The Phase 2 (002-shared-contracts-mock-data) mock fixtures live in
# `backend/src/whatsapp/fixtures/` instead of here, because the backend
# tsconfig sets `rootDir: "src"` and would reject imports of files outside it
# (TS6059). Keep this directory for future fixtures that are not imported by
# the backend build (e.g. data consumed only by test runners).
